==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|речи}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*reťi}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|-ре́чь}}

===Combining form===
{{ru-verb-cform|-ре́чь|pf|impf=-река́ть}}

# {{n-g|Combining form used to form prefixed perfective verbs, with the approximate meaning "to say".}}

====Usage notes====
* Do not confuse this with the noun {{m|ru|речь||[[speech]]}}. In pre-reform spelling, the noun was spelled {{m|ru|рѣчь}} and the verbal combining form {{m|ru|-речь}}.

